This is README file to help you do:
1. run QUnit Test.
    >mvn clean install
2. run JSCoverage and generate report.
    >mvn clean integration-test -P test.build
3. run JSLint and generate report.
    >mvn -Djslint.run jslint:jslint
4. upload the report to Sonar server.
    >mvn sonar:sonar

you could find the report result here.
    https://sonarqube.example.com/